# Skyseer's Chariot: "Activated abilities of sources with the chosen name cost {2} more to activate." Bot1 names Smuggler's
# Copter as the Chariot enters. Casting a Copter is not activating an ability, so Bot1's turn-1 Copter costs its printed {2}. Crewing
# a Copter costs {2} more for either player (CR 602.2b): on turn 3 Bot1 crews with Grizzly Bears paying exactly {2} (the other two
# Moxen cast the Bears), and on turn 4 Bot2 does the same, leaving its other two Moxen untapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Skyseer's Chariot
Smuggler's Copter
Grizzly Bears
Mountain x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Smuggler's Copter
Grizzly Bears
Island
Island x13

